I've cooked up a really quick version in Blender3d, nicely rendered. I
reccomend someone either try their hand at a better Blender version or
a Pov-ray version. It could be made to look a lot better than I have
it here. For one, I didn't add the torii you have going around the
edges of the coordinates.

I'm not sure whether I like the faceted surfaces, or whether a
smoothed version would be better.

